  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">HP - Early Intervention for Mental Health</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Through this project ECEC will sensitize parents in Belbari so they are more aware of the needs of their children. This will be done through group meetings using International Development Programme (ICDP). There will also be a focus on child friendly books that are linked to the school curriculum. They will not only focus on the cognitive aspects of the development of the child, but also on the emotional development of the children</narrative>
  </description>
